  "title": "Coconut Curry Chicken and Vegetables in the Slow Cooker",
  "description": "Try this easy coconut curry in your slow cooker with sweet potato, green beans, bell pepper, and onion. Serve over either riced cauliflower or jasmine rice.",
  "authors": [
    "Bibi"
  ],
